  "name": "mac-age-relearn",
  "lab": "Small lab",
  "title": "Silent host past bridge ageing, then relearn",
  "action": "Sets ageing-time=10s on the bridge of both MLAG peers and reads it back, and pins permanent neighbour entries between the MAC-move host and both traffic hosts, so no host needs ARP while one side is silent. After the baseline it drops every frame the MAC-move host sends for 25 s, with a tc filter on egress of both its bond members, then removes the filter and watches 5 s of return plus a 3 s recovery window. Afterwards it restores ageing-time=5m, reads it back and removes the pinned neighbour entries.",
